Z||000052||BN Boomer||12-23-2001||05:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>I just find it kind of strange that you are a big gun enthusiast, but you are waiting for an xbox under the christmas tree?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (I have the right person, right?)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>What on earth does that utter nonsense have to do with anything? Yes, it's a well recognized fact that being a gun enthusiast and enjoying playing video games with your children are mutually exclusive, correct?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>So what else does being a gun enthusiast prohibit me from enjoying or participating in?<P>||||reg||5
