Z||000060||BN Boomer||12-24-2001||05:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by REDHOTT88:<BR><B> [QUOTE]Originally posted by Kasdan:<BR>[b]*walks in, sees 9mm's flying, runs out*<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Finally a smart one!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>[/B][/QUOTE]<P>Only if he can run faster than a 9mm!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
